# Paragraph ▸ Link Reference splits the paragraph at the caret with an
# empty definition, the caret in its label. It stays a definition while
# it is filled in, and the links that use it follow.
write @DIR@/doc.md See [the site][s] here.\n
cmd openPath @DIR@/doc.md
wait 400
caret 0 23
cmd linkReference
wait 300
check view.itemAt(1).kind === "linkref"
type s
key End
type https://typora.io
wait 300
check view.itemAt(1).kind === "linkref" && model.linkAt(0, 6) === "https://typora.io"
dump @OUT@
